+
+## gin_supervised_contextpred / gin_supervised_edgepred / gin_supervised_infomax / gin_supervised_masking
+
+- `jk`: (str) The way to aggregate the output of all GNN layers. One of `'concat'`, `'last'`, `'max'`, 
